urbing themes. Meant for mature audiences only.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/icon.png?t=1752920875\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>shame and choices = possible apocalypse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>narrative rpg game</strong> where choices have severe consequences, and <strong>shame </strong>and<strong> mental health</strong> affects possibilities and limitations, set in a world that's like a minefield where your actions can cause the world to reach a <strong>dead end.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game takes place during <strong>7 days</strong> - Monday to Sunday. There will be several <strong>different possible endings</strong>.<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about the effects of shame and mind and try different choices, and don\u2019t be afraid to fail - some mistakes can lead to new knowledge after all :))</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your vessel of shame!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/bild_till_beskrivning.png?t=1752920875\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as either <strong>Elias </strong>or <strong>Felix </strong>and discover their filthy secrets, get to know their complicated families and try to reach Sunday without fucking everything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Who are these boys you can play as ? Which one should you play as? Let's ask the parents of the boys!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elliott, tell me about your son.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elliott:<i> &quot;Hmm ... Elias ... Well ... He's ... a psychopathic pervert and aggressive animal who began life by murdering his own mother. Don't play as him. Who knows what he's capable of ...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Okay ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levi, should I play as your son, Felix, (or as you call him, Cain)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levi: <i>&quot;Ha! Sure, if you want to play as a pathetic coward and special snowflake with strong school shooter vibes that will probably end up becoming an incel ...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you trust the words of the parents..? What kind of people are these boys,\u00a0 actually......?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/extras/bild_till_beskrivning_2.png?t=1752920875\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which character you choose to play as will greatly affect your experience, and it\u2019s recommended to try to play as both characters to get the fullest picture of their world and understand how and why it can reach a dead end because of your choices or lack thereof, and to figure out how to avoid it happening.</p>","developers":["Micki Holmgren"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767990/34f010b75c5077cb6452bf9eff999f54c26ba358/header.jpg?t=1752920875","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.10 or better<br></li><li><strong